{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026TlTnSSy02F1793223869.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本千葉縣發生5.5級地震，當局沒有發出海嘯警報，暫時未有傷亡報告。</p><p></p><p>事發在當地凌晨零時07分，氣象廳指震央在千葉縣東北部，震源深度約50公里。千葉縣、埼玉縣、茨城縣部分地區，以及東京有震感。美國地質勘探局表示，強度為黎克特制5.5級，震源深度為41公里。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:00:44.475046+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T21:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T01:38:08.585984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T22:58:13.344506+00:00","content_hash":"5c777314cb22a2a8344f6fb8a1b3924a725abe52c510df9c074692a47ccdd6c1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:00:44.475046+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}